sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant FE2 as Frontend (destinatário)
  participant APIG as API Gateway
  participant PRJ as Projects Service
  participant DB as MongoDB (projects)
  participant WSG as wsGateway
  participant FE as Frontend (dono)

  alt permission == edit
    FE2->>APIG: POST/PUT/DELETE /projects/share/:token/tool...
    APIG->>PRJ: /share/:token/tool...
    PRJ->>DB: update pipeline (tools)
    PRJ->>WSG: emit project-update(projectId)
    WSG-->>FE2: WS: project-update
    WSG-->>FE: WS: project-update
    Note over FE2,FE: Concorrência: last-write-wins (LWW)

    Note over FE2,PRJ: Processamento/cancelamento também exige edit
    FE2->>APIG: POST /projects/share/:token/process (ou /preview/:img)
    APIG->>PRJ: POST /share/:token/process (ou /preview/:img)
    PRJ->>DB: validar token + ensureShareEdit
    PRJ-->>APIG: 201/204
  else permission == view
    FE2-->>FE2: UI read-only + botões desativados
    FE2->>APIG: POST /projects/share/:token/tool...
    APIG->>PRJ: /share/:token/tool...
    PRJ-->>APIG: 403 Link does not grant edit permissions
    APIG-->>FE2: erro (403)
  end

  Note over FE,APIG: Gestão de links (autenticada)
  FE->>APIG: POST /projects/:uid/:pid/share/:token/revoke
  APIG->>PRJ: POST /:uid/:pid/share/:token/revoke (auth)
  PRJ->>DB: revoked=true
  PRJ-->>APIG: 204
  APIG-->>FE: 204

  Note over FE2,PRJ: Depois de revogado
  FE2->>APIG: GET /projects/share/:token
  APIG->>PRJ: GET /share/:token
  PRJ-->>APIG: 404 Invalid or revoked link
  APIG-->>FE2: erro (mensagem clara)
